{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "011min_403_2_4_011_03_09_b",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:80622125d1e91ffcf6b57e487834246402e86e4bd90e1ae622c3f0aa7283cd1a",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:011min_403_2_4_011_03_09_b:2_4_011_03_09_b:cmd-000008:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aaefa64a2db8e896646a0230175912d33ff9c600bab0790ff54ed36a4963fcef",
      "text": "喂喂，●●●●プロデューサー？我现在，\n正和皮埃尔还有恭二一起在赏花呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:011min_403_2_4_011_03_09_b:2_4_011_03_09_b:cmd-000010:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e990bcf3135abf8042093820913a5295da17b2afd8271d480c9f0bf91cb9414f",
      "text": "给他们俩拍了很多很棒的照片，\n想着要不要发到SNS上去。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:011min_403_2_4_011_03_09_b:2_4_011_03_09_b:cmd-000012:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:daadd3e8f947d5ac940211c3ec87e30978ac66bcbefe94dbee7febd5193922d3",
      "text": "稍后能帮我检查一下吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:011min_403_2_4_011_03_09_b:2_4_011_03_09_b:cmd-000014:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:59c55d4b878df63d50ff372587f8319ae3821c1cf3fe8c6bce31cf184b4a7c34",
      "text": "明白了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:011min_403_2_4_011_03_09_b:2_4_011_03_09_b:cmd-000015:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9c3e0eab7135bbf0124c363d162784a0708abfe045d94917138ffb36a58b21a3",
      "text": "当然可以！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:011min_403_2_4_011_03_09_b:2_4_011_03_09_b:cmd-000019:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d5c0f90744a45026c0848a9a3c9637dfc1a963138f5af4d20de9d90a7be06bc8",
      "text": "谢谢！\n回去之后，我会把精选的照片发邮件给你的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:011min_403_2_4_011_03_09_b:2_4_011_03_09_b:cmd-000021:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0c56b23416480d8989f52e8e4729ed62aa3f9e2fbb5903a3fde86f8ca579ad6b",
      "text": "对了对了。之前的拍摄中，艺术家老师\n教了我拍照的技巧哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:011min_403_2_4_011_03_09_b:2_4_011_03_09_b:cmd-000023:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4b8273cba73a26bb5d8f49cd680fd34a19a727a588c6ef8b8f9921923f0957a0",
      "text": "我以他们俩和花朵为模特试了一下，\n拍出了非常棒的照片呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:011min_403_2_4_011_03_09_b:2_4_011_03_09_b:cmd-000025:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:661e888acc26df90a44c0da4c5a5db1e238b49cbe2dccbc2c947ca8a91615800",
      "text": "摄影这门学问，还真是深奥又有趣呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:011min_403_2_4_011_03_09_b:2_4_011_03_09_b:cmd-000027:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fe5cda4d240ac343f29f5570819698cf82f5e19a96f1902c61123528bdc123ef",
      "text": "……啊，皮埃尔好像发现了什么东西。\n是有什么罕见的花吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:011min_403_2_4_011_03_09_b:2_4_011_03_09_b:cmd-000029:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d3880d5edb2df10f5ded42ae92e1ee39107d197cbd25ea0376d05fd8692048db",
      "text": "我再去给他们俩多拍几张。制作人的照片，\n什么时候我也想拍拍看呢。那就先这样。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
